Error [jet.CallerSiteMisplaced]: `$caller` is legal only as a parameter default or inside an #Expand macro.
  --> tests/ui/caller_site_misplaced.jet:5:9
    |
  5 |     at: $caller
    |         ^^^^^^^
 Why: `$caller` is the place of the call that left the parameter out; anywhere else there is no call to name.
 Fix: Declare a parameter `at: SourceLocation{$caller}` and read `at`, or write `$here` for this line.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2427
